  "rationale": "The batch exposes several recurring closing and connective contexts whose target tokens currently have very little output mass: “all for now.”, “That/This is …”, and “And that was …”. The representative “Ben and the” error is also a genuine ambiguity between a noun and an adjective, so I avoid forcing a particular noun there. These bounded suffix rules add evidence for reusable lexical constructions without copying whole stories. They may overfavor these continuations in other contexts with the same suffix, and other valid continuations should remain possible; the replay gate must assess that risk.",
